  "name": "Send a weekly analytics report as a formatted HTML email with an AI summary",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "79f0f0c5-225e-4374-bf2b-8c2108987a77",
      "name": "Schedule Weekly",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        48,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "204aa4a6-5bcc-4f67-a28a-0d2f3d5d959f",
      "name": "Get Weekly Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        272,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "",
          "cachedResultName": "Metrics"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "",
          "cachedResultName": "Select your spreadsheet"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "credential-id",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.7
    },
    {
      "id": "9b1edb80-ad88-4494-ac42-8788dafbcb2f",
      "name": "Compute KPIs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        480,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.all().map(function (i) { return i.json; });\nconst totals = {};\nfor (const r of rows) {\n  const name = r.Metric || r.metric || r.KPI || 'Metric';\n  const v = Number(String(r.Value != null ? r.Value : (r.value || 0)).replace(/[^0-9.-]/g, '')) || 0;\n  if (!totals[name]) { totals[name] = { name: name, total: 0, count: 0 }; }\n  totals[name].total += v;\n  totals[name].count += 1;\n}\nconst metrics = Object.keys(totals).map(function (k) { const t = totals[k]; return { name: t.name, total: Math.round(t.total), average: Math.round(t.total / Math.max(t.count, 1)) }; });\nconst summaryText = metrics.map(function (m) { return m.name + ': total ' + m.total + ', avg ' + m.average; }).join('\\n');\nreturn [{ json: { rowCount: rows.length, metrics: metrics, summaryText: summaryText } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "6425f6c2-3d1a-4eb7-92c3-0b7b67357370",
      "name": "Write Executive Summary with Gemini",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        720,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a data analyst writing the top of a weekly report for busy executives. From the metrics below, write 3-4 short sentences: the headline story of the week, the strongest and weakest metric, and one thing to watch next week. No bullet points, plain sentences, and do not restate every number.\n\nMetrics:\n{{ $json.summaryText }}",
        "batching": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.9
    },
    {
      "id": "d29400d2-52a9-4923-8e2b-0fd9c0d94cdf",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "position": [
        720,
        208
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4
        },
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "credential-id",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "aeb7aee7-8aa2-4ede-97e9-d60a2f6b5681",
      "name": "Build HTML Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.html",
      "position": [
        1040,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "html": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: auto; color: #222;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color:#111;\">Weekly report</h2>\n  <p style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;\">{{ $('Write Executive Summary with Gemini').item.json.text }}</p>\n  <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-top:16px;\">\n    <tr style=\"background:#f4f4f5; text-align:left;\">\n      <th style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;\">Metric</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;\">Total</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;\">Average</th>\n    </tr>\n    {{ $('Compute KPIs').item.json.metrics.map(m => `<tr><td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">${m.name}</td><td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">${m.total}</td><td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">${m.average}</td></tr>`).join('') }}\n  </table>\n  <p style=\"color:#888; font-size:12px; margin-top:16px;\">Generated automatically from {{ $('Compute KPIs').item.json.rowCount }} rows.</p>\n</div>"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "3d889a9b-246c-4441-916f-ffc970b54222",
      "name": "Email HTML Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
        1392,
        48
      ],
      "webhookId": "16f455b5-88a3-403d-943b-d622cdd177c2",
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "user@example.com",
        "message": "={{ $json.html }}",
        "options": {},
        "subject": "={{ \"Weekly report - \" + $now.toFormat(\"d LLLL yyyy\") }}"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "credential-id",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "dcab80b8-f9b6-400e-acbf-c52ceb2a3185",
      "name": "Overview Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -608,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 584,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## Send a weekly analytics report as a formatted HTML email with an AI summary\n\n### How it works\nRaw spreadsheets do not make good executive updates. Each week this template reads your metrics from Google Sheets and a Code node totals and averages them by metric. A Basic LLM Chain with Google Gemini then writes a short executive summary at the top - the headline story, the strongest and weakest metric, and what to watch next week - in plain sentences, not a wall of numbers. An HTML node renders the summary plus a clean metrics table into a styled email, and Gmail sends it as real HTML so it looks like a designed report in the inbox rather than a data dump.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect Google Sheets, Google Gemini (PaLM) API and Gmail.\n2. Put your weekly numbers in a sheet with Metric and Value columns.\n3. Set the recipient and adjust the schedule.\n\n### Customization tips\nAdd week-over-week comparison, or embed a chart image from a charting API."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b1cce1d7-73fa-4d02-b341-043568b7839e",
      "name": "S1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 608,
        "height": 524,
        "content": "## 1. Read & compute\nRun weekly, read the metrics sheet and total/average each KPI in a Code node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "77bd6ab6-b161-442b-9fcc-10764ccd69b5",
      "name": "S2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        624,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 580,
        "height": 524,
        "content": "## 2. Executive summary (Basic LLM Chain)\nGemini writes a short, plain-language summary of the week from the computed KPIs."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fac20df5-9022-4ec9-9cdb-c26032c49970",
